# 13. SMART FOOD PREPARATION

Do not simply show predicted demand.

Calculate recommended preparation quantity.

Formula:

Recommended Quantity =

Predicted Demand + Safety Buffer − Current Inventory

Example:

Predicted Samosa Demand = 90

Safety Buffer = 10%

Current ready inventory = 20

Recommended preparation:

79

Show:

```text
Samosa

Predicted Demand: 90

Safety Buffer: 9

Current Inventory: 20

Recommended Preparation: 79
```

The safety buffer should be configurable by admin.

